    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d353">

                <pb facs="0616" n="596" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg596"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-04-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 27, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: Recurring to your note of the 4th
                    instant, respecting the case of James McHugh, I have the honor to inform your
                    lordship, in reply, that I learn from Major General Dix that the military
                    commission which investigated the case have reported that, in their judgment,
                    McHugh should be released.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, my lord, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM. H. SEWARD,</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord, Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
